+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: the paper's Section III-A Algorithms 1-3 give polynomial-time "
+        "triangle counters; the shipping reference uses forward-neighbour "
+        "enumeration in O(V*Delta^2), with wall-clock and operation count measured "
+        "by selftest, whereas the coordinate-change route uses at most 288 exact "
