codex
The oracle budget became an external blocker mid-run: Terra failed the instance, Gemini solved it, and every subsequent required redraw returned OpenRouter HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded (total limit).” The harness correctly aborted instead of counting those errors as failures. I’ll preserve this partial evidence, inspect the solved response for a real generator weakness, harden that weakness locally, and retry once; if the account remains exhausted, I’ll report the missing external evidence honestly rather than manufacture transcripts.
