+Paper reading and STEP-0 decision
+---------------------------------
+Section III-A fixes the native task used here: count unordered triples of
+mutually adjacent vertices.  Section III-B instead defines k-trusses.  Despite
+the title, the paper does not formulate the general planted pattern-mapping
+problem assumed by the prior triage, so no subgraph-isomorphism surrogate is
+used.
 
+The certificate-producing algorithm is displayed in Section III-A, Algorithm
+2: form A^2, mask by A, sum, and divide by six.  The stronger specialization to
+a succinct circulant input enumerates all ordered pairs of connection steps in
+O(|S|^2).  An efficient exact method is therefore known and this family is
