codex
The live harness is configured for more than the prompt’s nominal three escalations and has advanced to `n=1024`; I’m preserving the sanctioned run rather than intervening. The family still has a fixed nine-atom answer, but a held rung this large would make the required explicit reference enumeration impractical, so that will factor into the final ship/park decision.
