codex
Parked, not shipped.

The paper’s native kernels are triangle counting and k-truss—not arbitrary planted subgraph search—so the generator uses its eight-neighbour image graphs as a Track B family. All local gates pass:

- G1: 12/12 planted witnesses verified.
- G4: 0/200,000 structure-aware guesses.
- G6: six attacks failed 0/8; reference algorithm solved 8/8.
- Reference cost: 10,166,691 operations, 3–6 seconds.
- Compact route: 279 operations; answer is 94 characters and 9 atoms.

